# Four Week Course Grand Finale

It's the last for the year and it's going to be FUN!! Join us for the very last course for 2015. This four week course begins November 17th and runs for four consecutive weeks.  We will be celebrating the end of drum and dance classes at the Palmwoods Christmas Party on December 12th where we will play our favourite rhythms from the year!! Everyone is welcome to come and join in so let your family and friends know and invite them to come along! You can still book your four week course online [here](/product/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/) and dancing will also continue as normal with a brand new rhythm. Same time, same place. Beginner Drumming 5.30pm----Open African Dance Class 6.30pm----Experienced Drumming 7.30pm [![Four week course](/media/2015/11/240715-tuesdaydance-for-print-1.jpg)](/media/2015/11/240715-tuesdaydance-for-print-1.jpg) [![Four week course](/media/2015/11/new-drumming-240715-for-print.jpg)](/media/2015/11/new-drumming-240715-for-print-1.jpg)
